{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01036","headline":"相和歌辞 江南曲八首 二 · 刘希夷","name":"相和歌辞 江南曲八首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"艳唱潮初落，江花露未曦。\n春洲惊翡翠，朱服弄芳菲。\n画舫烟中浅，青阳日际微。\n锦帆冲浪湿，罗袖拂行衣。\n含情罢所采，相叹惜流晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}